= Tobias Leighart

Leighart is a leader of the Greater Worker's Guild, the largest federation of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformist</span> Free Guilds.

- @organizing
- @depression
- @schleicher
- @root: Return to main

# leipart was one of the people who argued for Free Guild independence
#- @union_unity

@organizing
title: Organizing workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the workers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; commons_marcher += 4*(1-dissent); commons_marcher += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted == 1; labor_strength += 2;

We have increased our organizing among the workers.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to get us out of this mess.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted = 0 and veran_crash_seen
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if veran_crash_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Voss Renewal Plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 5; wtb_points += 15

[? if not wtb_concept: Voss, Whell, and Bayle, has been working together to draft a plan for getting us out of the depression. Leighart canvasses in favor of this policy throughout the party and the Free Guilds. ?][? if wtb_concept: The Voss Renewal Plan, named for its primary supporters Voss, Whell, and Bayle, has been adopted as the Free Guilds' plan for getting us out of the depression. Leighart canvasses in favor of this policy throughout the party and the Free Guilds. ?]

@schleicher
title: Negotiating with the Red General
subtitle: Leighart will attempt to convince the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> to support Staal.
view-if: red_general_unlock and rubicon
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; red_general_timer -= 4 if not staal_marcher_adopted; red_general_timer -= 6 if staal_marcher_adopted; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: red_general


@union_unity
title: Free Guild-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the Free Guilds.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction, and increased its strength in the party.